.TH HALOGEN 1
.SH NAME
halogen \- perspective driving demo
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/halogen
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Halogen
is a perspective driving demo.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Steer and accelerate along a perspective road. There is no finish line.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Left / a
Steer left
.TP
.B Right / d
Steer right
.TP
.B Up / w
Accelerate
.TP
.B Down / s
Slow
.TP
.B r / Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/halogen.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR wm (1)
